  "task": "Find the value of x to the nearest tenth: Lx = (d/dx * (A * x-squared)) + 4-thousand'n'ninety-7 minus C Where L is the last two digits of the year of the Venezuelan Declaration of Independence, A is the number of colors in the TikTok logo as of July 2023, excluding black and white, and C is the height of the average woman in the Philippines according to a July 2023 Business Insider article, rounded to the nearest whole centimeter"
